{"id":"bcafee5865ad5eb59806b4d4255b4ba579f503d1","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1240788","title":"claude 这个“⬇️”的翻页按钮和 quick answer 按钮在前端上是重叠的，这个设计是不是顺飞？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"HvangStormstout","excerpt":"Claude - @HvangStormstout - https://i.imgur.com/if3dQK9.png","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/if3dQK9.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/if3dQK9.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/重叠\"><li></li> 重叠</a><a href=\"/tag/设计\"><li></li> 设计</a><a href=\"/tag/用户体验\"><li></li> 用户体验</a></P><p><span>6 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-10 01:38:34 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068159\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/10d2/6aa8/636697_normal.png?m=1738982140\" alt=\"KJH\" data-uid=\"636697\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/KJH\">KJH</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 20:28:41 +08:00\">23h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>帅哥，问一下，你最近用 claude 响应慢吗？为啥我随便一个任务都要跑一个小时？一个小时消耗才几十 K 的 token ，这明显不对呀，我感觉我被限速了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068160\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/10d2/6aa8/636697_normal.png?m=1738982140\" alt=\"KJH\" data-uid=\"636697\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/KJH\">KJH</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 20:29:22 +08:00\">23h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/rM8pCkc.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rM8pCkc.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068296\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3092/b300/142999_normal.png?m=1775026975\" alt=\"fhiutc\" data-uid=\"142999\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fhiutc\">fhiutc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 21:27:00 +08:00\">22h 42m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/KJH\">KJH</a> 你思考开太强了，思考过程中是没有输出的； opus5 不如 fable5.1 开 medium ，速度也快的多</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068329\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/10d2/6aa8/636697_normal.png?m=1738982140\" alt=\"KJH\" data-uid=\"636697\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/KJH\">KJH</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 21:43:11 +08:00\">22h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/fhiutc\">fhiutc</a> 我一直用的是 Opus5 Max ，每次都跑的很快，最长也就半个多小时，最起码能跑接近 1M 的 token ，现在是 1 小时连 100k 的 token 都跑不到，我不知道是 claude 优化了啥还是做了限速，真没这么慢过</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068417\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/10d2/6aa8/636697_normal.png?m=1738982140\" alt=\"KJH\" data-uid=\"636697\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/KJH\">KJH</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 22:24:41 +08:00\">21h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/fhiutc\">fhiutc</a> 我试了试 Fable 5.1  Medium ，  感觉速度没区别，你也这样么。。<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/ofu8Na8.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ofu8Na8.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068638\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/97d4/d848/37262_normal.png?m=1787493483\" alt=\"haruhi\" data-uid=\"37262\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/haruhi\">haruhi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 01:38:34 +08:00\">18h 31m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/KJH\">KJH</a></p><p>看你具体跑的是什么任务，比如 Research 任务、或者一开始就定好规划的自动化长任务，那么就是比较长的。</p><p>最近跑的 (定好状态机、规划，基本上就是 Claude 全自动写、自动交给 GPT 来 Review 、返回结果后自动化测试、没问题就继续到下一个阶段)：</p><p>1h 25m 32s<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/CaNizdM.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CaNizdM.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p>3h 13m 35s<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/p4i0kJj.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p4i0kJj.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"重叠 设计 用户体验6 replies • 2026-09-10 01:38:34 +08:00 1 KJH 23h 41m ago 帅哥，问一下，你最近用 claude 响应慢吗？为啥我随便一个任务都要跑一个小时？一个小时消耗才几十 K 的 token ，这明显不对呀，我感觉我被限速了 2 KJH 23h 40m ago 3 fhiutc 22h 42m ago 1 @KJH 你思考开太强了，思考过程中是没有输出的； opus5 不如 fable5.1 开 medium ，速度也快的多 4 KJH 22h 26m ago @fhiutc 我一直用的是 Opus5 Max ，每次都跑的很快，最长也就半个多小时，最起码能跑接近 1M 的 token ，现在是 1 小时连 100k 的 token 都跑不到，我不知道是 claude 优化了啥还是做了限速，真没这么慢过 5 KJH 21h 45m ago @fhiutc 我试了试 Fable 5.1 Medium ， 感觉速度没区别，你也这样么。。 6 haruhi 18h 31m ago 1 @KJH看你具体跑的是什么任务，比如 Research 任务、或者一开始就定好规划的自动化长任务，那么就是比较长的。最近跑的 (定好状态机、规划，基本上就是 Claude 全自动写、自动交给 GPT 来 Review 、返回结果后自动化测试、没问题就继续到下一个阶段)：1h 25m 32s3h 13m 35s","fetched_at":"2026-09-10T12:09:44.932Z","ok":true}